# Player Access & Auth (MVP)

## Login

- Mobile OTP only
- Dev/local: dummy fixed OTP
- **KMSI**: session persists until explicit sign-out (`signOut`)

## Gate

1. Not authenticated → `/login`
2. Authenticated but **not** active member of Ranches Thunders → access denied
3. Active member with incomplete profile → force `/complete-profile`
4. Else → app

## Profile

- Mandatory basic profile on first login
- Later: edit allowed fields only (name, avatar, etc.)
- Phone is identity; treat as largely immutable after verify

## Participation

- Vote availability + carpool
- Change votes until freeze
- Pay settlements
- Admin who is also player uses the same player flows
